          "title": "You'll want to know: பண்பு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பண்பு — paṇpu — \"a virtue; good character\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "உண்மை பேசுவது ஒரு நல்ல பண்பு. uṇmai pēcuvatu oru nalla paṇpu. Speaking the truth is a good quality."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பண்பான, well-mannered."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பண்பு (paṇpu) is native Dravidian (DEDR 3904), a word for quality, nature and good character."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
